    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a role-playing adventure featuring the protagonist &quot;Kim Joongbung,&quot; an ordinary unemployed person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing a rumor that collecting classic games can lead to a great job at a game company, &quot;Kim Joongbung&quot; embarks on a journey to gather classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about &quot;Kim Joong-boong,&quot; a lifelong unemployed man, struggling to live a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people in the village to gather information for collecting items.<br>Defeat monsters or collect items to earn monetary rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the journey, you will encounter various powerful monsters that you must fight and defeat.<br>Overcome unbeatable monsters by leveling up and gaining strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be able to defeat monsters at Level 1.<br>Converse with villagers and open all treasure chests to purchase armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather all the items required by the game to achieve your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Page Up key during the game to view the current mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Page Down to make it disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Arrow keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong>: Left Shift key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View Mission</strong>: Page Up, Page Down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View Options</strong>: ESC key</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a role-playing adventure featuring the protagonist &quot;Kim Joongbung,&quot; an ordinary unemployed person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing a rumor that collecting classic games can lead to a great job at a game company, &quot;Kim Joongbung&quot; embarks on a journey to gather classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about &quot;Kim Joong-boong,&quot; a lifelong unemployed man, struggling to live a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people in the village to gather information for collecting items.<br>Defeat monsters or collect items to earn monetary rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the journey, you will encounter various powerful monsters that you must fight and defeat.<br>Overcome unbeatable monsters by leveling up and gaining strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be able to defeat monsters at Level 1.<br>Converse with villagers and open all treasure chests to purchase armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather all the items required by the game to achieve your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Page Up key during the game to view the current mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Page Down to make it disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Arrow keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong>: Left Shift key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View Mission</strong>: Page Up, Page Down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View Options</strong>: ESC key</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The game genre is a modern role-playing game. You can move around the village using the arrow keys, talk to people, and open treasure chests. You can experience the life of a young person that could happen in reality.",
